WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.947
In this tour, you'll see what your members
see in the B1.church app.

00:00:03.947 --> 00:00:08.127
Members open your church's B1.church
address, sign in, and land on Home.

00:00:08.927 --> 00:00:12.364
Home greets you by name, and it only shows
the sections that apply to you.

00:00:13.164 --> 00:00:15.520
You're serving lists your next serving
times.

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.505
If one needs an answer, tap Accept or
Decline right here.

00:00:19.305 --> 00:00:22.416
Below that are your groups, and upcoming
events from those groups.

00:00:23.216 --> 00:00:27.147
The tab bar at the bottom holds Home, up
to three tabs your church chooses, and

00:00:27.147 --> 00:00:27.396
More.

00:00:28.196 --> 00:00:30.890
On a computer, the same links run across
the top of the page.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:32.619
Tap Groups.

00:00:33.419 --> 00:00:34.852
Here are the groups you're in.

00:00:34.852 --> 00:00:37.383
Find a Group lets you browse what your
church offers.

00:00:37.383 --> 00:00:38.481
Tap a group to open it.

00:00:39.281 --> 00:00:43.377
The group page shows when it meets, the
next event, and its leaders and members.

00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:45.272
Tap Open chat to talk with the group.

00:00:46.072 --> 00:00:48.487
It's one simple place for the group to
stay in touch.

00:00:49.287 --> 00:00:50.448
Next, tap Plans.

00:00:51.248 --> 00:00:55.869
Plans shows the times you're scheduled to
serve, and any that still need your reply.

00:00:55.869 --> 00:00:56.914
Tap one to open it.

00:00:57.714 --> 00:01:01.484
You'll see your assignment, the service
order, and who else is serving, so you

00:01:01.484 --> 00:01:02.451
know what to expect.

00:01:03.251 --> 00:01:04.412
Now tap Check-in.

00:01:05.212 --> 00:01:07.836
Members can check in their household right
from their phone.

00:01:07.836 --> 00:01:08.974
First, choose the service.

00:01:09.774 --> 00:01:13.563
Then, under Who's here, choose groups for
each family member, and tap Complete

00:01:13.563 --> 00:01:14.000
Check-in.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:18.329
When an event has registration turned on,
you'll see a Register link on it.

00:01:19.129 --> 00:01:21.033
Tap it, and follow the steps to sign up.

00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:22.808
Now tap More.

00:01:23.608 --> 00:01:26.953
More lists every tab your church set up,
plus your account options.

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:30.249
Under Appearance, you can switch between
Light Mode and Dark Mode.

00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:32.210
Here's Dark Mode.

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:33.753
Tap Me.

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:35.714
Me is your personal page.

00:01:35.714 --> 00:01:39.383
It shows what's coming up for you, your
groups, your forms, and your attendance

00:01:39.383 --> 00:01:39.754
history.

00:01:40.554 --> 00:01:44.587
The bell at the top opens your inbox, with
your messages, your notifications, and

00:01:44.587 --> 00:01:46.080
your notification preferences.

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:49.109
Tap your profile picture to open your
profile.

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:54.225
Here you can update your photo, your
contact info, your household, and your

00:01:54.225 --> 00:01:55.203
privacy settings.

00:01:56.003 --> 00:01:59.068
To keep the app handy, go to More, and tap
Install App.

00:01:59.868 --> 00:02:01.284
Follow the steps for your device.

00:02:01.284 --> 00:02:03.258
There's nothing to download from an app
store.

00:02:04.058 --> 00:02:04.906
Here's a tip.

00:02:04.906 --> 00:02:10.060
Members only see the tabs your church
picks, so set those up in B1 Admin, under

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:11.626
Mobile, then Navigation.

00:02:11.626 --> 00:02:13.779
Next, take a tour of B1 Check-In.

00:02:13.779 --> 00:02:17.433
And for step by step help, visit
support.churchapps.org.
